2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"jqizXUuIQmSZ2gloidWUMw","review_id":"gQYFfrFIGPot-0mzj3tXkA","date":"2016-01-04T00:35:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9381970167160034,"text_excerpt":"Angeline was lovely. From the service to the ambiance to the food - we enjoyed everything. Joe served us and was really great. We absolutely adored the Crispy Cauliflower that we'd heard about and also enjoyed our entrees all around. Two in our group had the Crab Pasta and loved it. I had the Fish and it was great! The desserts were also lovely and the coffee was sublime. I was pleased to discover this beautiful place and will definitely be back when I return to New Orleans."},{"business_id":"jqizXUuIQmSZ2gloidWUMw","review_id":"DMD8iza1qZWaHj4-fj8RuQ","date":"2016-07-27T19:12:03","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9370212554931641,"text_excerpt":"Went for a Sunday brunch - everything we ordered was delicious and loved the decor & ambiance of the restaurant. The waitress was very informed of all items on the menu (both drinks and food) and gave us great suggestions. My favorite dishes were the biscuits, the grits & fried oyster appetizer, and the shrimp and grits entree. (Just get anything with grits and you'll be glad you did). Will definitely be going back here to try out the dinner menu."},{"business_id":"jqizXUuIQmSZ2gloidWUMw","review_id":"IcxKN4eM9XRiItqWPaMyUg","date":"2016-12-18T04:55:18","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9366874694824219,"text_excerpt":"Absolutely wonderful place. I came here for a birthday party of 10 and everything was handled quickly and deliciously. I asked the staff to bring out a candle with dessert and they were so sweet about bringing out dessert even though we were so full that no one was able to eat anymore! Overall, the food was upscale Southern and fantastic. Two things that I remember about the menu. First, the charcuterie plate is NOT a stereotypical plate but very much a New Orleans/Southern type of plate. Therefore, if you get it, make sure you read the menu and consider its components carefully so you have the right expectations when it comes out. Second, the steak dish is out of this world. There is SO ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"jqizXUuIQmSZ2gloidWUMw","photo_id":"W6pfoLwrT-9-AKPnZBh6Og","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/W6pfoLwrT-9-AKPnZBh6Og.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9118664860725403},{"business_id":"jqizXUuIQmSZ2gloidWUMw","photo_id":"P_0mheEePB1b-eiWDnuC5A","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/P_0mheEePB1b-eiWDnuC5A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9118664264678955}]},"notebook_case":null}
